Third-party material bundled in vellum
======================================

vellum itself is MIT licensed (see DESCRIPTION and LICENSE). The following
material originates elsewhere and is redistributed under its own terms.


1. The `ltc` colour palettes  (R/palettes-ltc.R)
------------------------------------------------

Thirty-two colour palettes are transcribed from the `ltc` R package by Loukas
Theodosiou, retrieved 2026-08-05 at version 0.4.0.9000 from
https://github.com/loukesio/ltc-color-palettes. They are exposed in vellum
under the `ltc` palette family. The MIT licence of that package is reproduced
in full below, as its terms require.

